#### 10.2 미분 방정식 풀이

```julia
using DifferentialEquations, Plots

# 단순 ODE: dy/dt = -2y
function f(u, p, t)
    return -2 * u
end

u0 = 1.0
tspan = (0.0, 10.0)
prob = ODEProblem(f, u0, tspan)
sol = solve(prob)

# 그래프
plot(sol)
```

